==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Two Can]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You should bring a decent counter to Two Can here such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]]. Two Can is the only notable threat here.

